    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "みんなー、いっくよー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Okay, everyone, here we go!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そーれっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Take this!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よっと！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gotcha!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヨハナちゃん！\u3000お願い！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna! Your turn!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふん、任せなさい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heh, leave it to me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やーっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ha!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っと。ベップちゃん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Got it. Bepp!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いくわ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Here I come!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "たあーっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ha—!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よっしゃあ！\u3000いい感じ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes!! That's what I'm talking about!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くーっ！！\u3000もう１回よ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh!! One more time!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はーっ！\u3000楽しい～！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ha—! This is so much fun!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "たくさん遊んだね。\nふふ、結構疲れちゃったかも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We've been at it for a while. Hehe, I'm actually pretty worn out."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシも～。でも、まだまだ遊ぶんだから！\nね、ベップ！\u3000ヤンネさん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Same~ But we are absolutely not done yet! Right, Bepp? Janne?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれ？\u3000ヤンネさんは？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hm? Where'd Janne go?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うわーん！\u3000お母さん、どこー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Waaah! Mommy, where are you?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "子ども",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Child"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "君、一人？\u3000……お母さんがいなくなっちゃったの？\n……うん、それじゃあ一緒に探しましょうか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you here by yourself? ...Did you lose your mom? ...Okay then, let's go look for her together."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヤンネさんなら、さっきからああやって\n迷子の子とか沖に流されそうな子を助けてあげてるわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She's been doing that the whole time—helping lost children and anyone who looks like they're drifting out too far."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さすがヤンネさん……周りをよく見てるんだなぁ。\nもう根っこから聖戦士",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's Janne for you... She never misses a thing. A Sacred Knight right down to her bones."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でもせっかくの休暇だし、そういうのは\n係の人に任せてもいいのに",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But it's her vacation too. It's okay to let the staff handle that kind of thing, you know."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうなんだけど……癖になってるのよね。\nそれに、ただ休暇を楽しむのはそわそわしちゃって――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I know, but... it's just habit. And honestly, just sitting back and relaxing makes me a little restless—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "って、やだ、今日の鍛錬がまだだったわ。\nもう時間は遅いけど……日課は欠かさずやらなくちゃ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh no, I just realized I haven't done my training today. It's late, but... I can't skip my daily routine."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今から鍛錬ですか？\nたくさん遊んで、へとへとじゃ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're going to train now? After all that playing around, you must be exhausted..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ、あれくらい大したことないわ。\nそれに、運動後の柔軟は身体にいいのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, that was nothing. Besides, stretching after exercise is good for you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "せっかくだし、みんなでやりましょっか。\nイザナさんたちも呼んでくるわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We might as well all do it together. I'll go grab Izana and the others."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "聖戦士の鍛錬、どんなことするんだろう……\n私にもできるかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wonder what Sacred Knight training is actually like... Do you think I can keep up?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ……覚悟したほうがいい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna... brace yourself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヤンネさんの鍛錬は「ガチ」だから……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne does not mess around when it comes to training...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]